            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Your order has been reshipped. However, due to disturbances from the Antimatter Legion, the expected delivery time will be delayed a week and is expected to be delivered to you within 15 business days."
